<title>PHILIPPINES: RESEARCH ALERT - Selecta rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Selecta rated a buy.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Hung Kai Securities said on Wednesday it had rated Selecta Dairy Products Inc a buy due to expected higher earnings from lower raw material costs.</p>
<p>Selecta is the ice cream unit of diversified company RFM Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;A turnaround this fiscal year is a sure thing,&quot; said analyst Raul Ruiz, pointing out that the price of skimmed milk had now gone down to $1,900 per tonne from $2,400 last year and sugar had also declined to 950 pesos per 50-kg from 1,050 pesos.</p>
</text>
